      "title": "File:Loreto City Hall (42646547462).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/Loreto_City_Hall_%2842646547462%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Loreto_City_Hall_(42646547462).jpg",
