      "credit": "Hotel Posada de Las Flores",
      "source": "Hotel Posada de Las Flores (35411315672) (cropped)",
      "description": "This beautiful hotel features a glass-bottom swimming pool on a rooftop terrace that overlooks the Sea of Cortés and the Giganta Mountains. The beach is only 200 metres away.\nPosada de las Flores Loreto is located in the centre of Loreto, next to the main square and the Misión de Nuestra Señora de Loreto Temple. It features colonial Mexican décor with 18th-century furniture, talavera pottery and exposed beams.\nThe spiral central staircase gives a unique feel to this hotel and the open seating area downstairs feels just like home.",
